5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Hello everyone. I am curious about what actually finished in past awards. Let us see the records.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the human resources. Who is actually available to do the work?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I worry about the shared infrastructure. If the facilities are strained, the best science still fails.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The headline grant size is static, but the real purchasing power is shifting. I need to know what the agency still covers centrally.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I am worried about interruptions. I want to know where work actually gets delayed, before we commit the funds.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Ryuji, that is a vital point. I will check the closeout files to see what truly delivered.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, agreed. I will examine the staffing rolls to see who is actually present and who has left.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, the central coverage matters. I will check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities to see their current load.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, exactly. I will check the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers to see what the agency still absorbs centrally.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, I agree. I will check the incident logs on shared instrumentation to see where delays actually occur.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also look at the portfolio review of schedule overruns. It shows which projects actually finished on time.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also check the minutes on secondments and crew strength. That tells me who is genuinely committed to the work.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will also check the national computing agreement and facility day rates. That reveals the true cost of shared services.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the national repository deposit turnaround. It reveals hidden administrative costs that now land on the awardee.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will also check the station records from partner field sites. Weather and access issues often cause the most unexpected delays.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us see what the records tell us. The data will guide our choice.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,The numbers will speak. I will wait for the evidence before forming a final judgment.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. The state of the shared services will determine if the science can actually proceed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
